  "body_html": "<p>Transform your space into the ultimate sports haven with the football comforter set by Jeminise. Perfect for football players, fans, and coaches, this lightweight and soft bedding set features a stunning retro football flag design that adds a vibrant athletic touch to any bedroom, guestroom, or kids' room.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features custom text inputs allowing you to personalize the bedding with your choice of name and number.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric with a whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Designed for football lovers, making it an excellent sports-themed gift for birthdays, holidays, and special celebrations.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in standard US bedding sizes including Twin, Full, Queen, and King.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; quick-drying microfiber fabric gets fluffier with air drying without heat.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Includes 1 duvet cover or comforter with optional matching pillowcases and flat sheet covers.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Retro Football Flag</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>American Flag</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
